    "description": "The Eating Disorders Examination Questionnaire © (EDE-Q) is a self-report questionnaire based on the Eating Disorders Examination Interview. The questionnaire based on the Eating Disorders Examination Interview. The questionnaire includes twenty-eight questions related to the respondent behaviors ov",
